        "step_number": 2,
        "text": "Step 2: Recognize that \\(\\angle RPQ\\) and \\(\\angle RPS\\) are supplementary angles because they form a straight line at point P.\nTherefore, \\(\\angle RPS = 180^\\circ - \\angle RPQ\\)."
      },
      {
